body+='<h3>Credential creation is not proof of unrestricted self-service</h3>'+table(['Recorded access bucket','Apps / 79 with access evidence'],[(esc(k),str(v['count'])+'/79') for k,v in m['access_buckets'].items()])+'<p>21/100 access records remain unresolved. These mutually exclusive buckets classify stored gates only. “Credential creation only” is a possible self-service route, not a certified free or ungated API. Review gates can apply to public distribution, and paid/admin gates can be resource-specific. Qualification text is retained in the matrix.</p>'
