section('categories','Category-level patterns', '<p>Each category contains ten assigned apps. Cells show evidence coverage, except the final three readiness group columns. Missing coverage is 10 minus the cell numerator; different field coverage prevents a uniform category ranking.</p>'+table(['Category','Purpose','Auth','Access','Type','Breadth','MCP yes','Build candidates','Gated','Investigate / unresolved'],ct)+'<p>Support has caveated MCP availability for 8/10 assigned apps versus 0/10 in ecommerce. The latter ten are unresolved for MCP, not established negatives. Finance has readiness evidence for 6/10 versus 10/10 in ecommerce, developer platforms and productivity. These differences reflect research coverage and stored inferences, not integration success or market-wide prevalence. Ecommerce purpose is unresolved for 10/10 even though API breadth is caveated for 10/10.</p>')
section('workflow','Research workflow and Composio usage','''<p>Assigned identities → bounded discovery and first-party retrieval → strict structured extraction → atomic evidence review → projected-field challenge → caveated dataset → targeted official-source corrections → fresh source review → reproducible pattern counts → standalone HTML.</p><p>The Python agent records source URLs, retrieval outcomes, source-text hashes, field references and failures. Semantic review distinguishes resource auth from token administration, API resources from product marketing, and native MCP from unrelated integrations. Checkpointed runs preserve the first pass and each correction layer.</p><p><strong>Composio was genuinely used in a separate augmentation path.</strong> The initial Composio authentication failed; the complete historical baseline used assigned seed-document discovery. After the key type was corrected to a Platform Project API key, tooling inspection selected <code>COMPOSIO_SEARCH_TAVILY</code>, version <code>20260903_00</code>, and eight successful augmentation searches were retained separately. It did not research all 100 apps through Composio. This final analysis/build makes no new research or paid API calls.</p><p><strong>Human boundary:</strong> Uday supplied 40 historical human review reports. Later targeted corrections and fresh current-source verification were conducted by a Codex agent, not fresh human app-detail verification. The user accepted those outcomes for progression. User acceptance is not an additional factual audit.</p><p>The semantic continuation froze at 96 extracted / 93 atom-reviewed / 84 valid field-reviewed apps after API credit exhaustion. Targeted official-source review added 117 field corrections across 14 apps; fresh review then added 25 corrections across 8 apps in a separate layer. Failed retrievals and unresolved identity never become negative product facts.</p>''')
vb='''<p><strong>No whole-dataset accuracy estimate is claimed.</strong> Evidence disposition, historical human review and fresh agent source review measure different things.</p>'''+table(['Layer','Denominator / result','Interpretation'],[['Historical first-pass human sample','7/35 scoreable claims correct before correction','Seed 42; 20 apps / 40 predeclared claims; 5 unclear and unscored.'],['Historical post-correction workflow','35/35 on the same scoreable claims','Judgments were supplied during correction; not independent accuracy. Historical sample agreement rose from 20% to 100% (+80 percentage points), not a population accuracy gain.'],['Fresh purposive source review','20 apps / 60 original records: 47 correct; 8 caveat_needed; 5 unsupported; 0 unverifiable','Six correct records are appropriately unresolved cases, not positive supported claims.'],['Bounded expansion','15 additional records: 3 correct; 12 caveat_needed','Separate from original 60; 25 field corrections across 8 apps applied after review. Corrected values are not counted as fresh independent successes.']])
vb+='<p>Fresh sources were observed before full sample-value comparison where feasible. Initial handoff/sample reading exposed saved values: the review was not fully blinded, statistically independent, or performed by a new human reviewer. It is a purposive risk sample and does not support a dataset-wide accuracy percentage.</p>'
vb+=table(['Overlapping fresh stratum','Records','Correct','Caveat needed','Unsupported','Unverifiable','Appropriately unresolved'],[[esc(k),s['records'],*[s['outcomes'].get(x,0) for x in ['correct','caveat_needed','unsupported','unverifiable']],s['appropriately_unresolved']] for k,s in hand['strata'].items()])
vb+='<p>Strata overlap and must not be summed. Preserved automated findings were the weak stratum; corrections address observed errors without certifying the unsampled records. Hits include the four sampled MCP ownership records and appropriately unresolved Paygent Connect/iPayX. Misses include GitHub and GoHighLevel auth labels, HubSpot CLI-token/UI-permission contamination, and Salesforce product-blog breadth. Amazon needed a listing-policy caveat; Gumroad/fanbasis unknowns were recoverable evidence gaps.</p>'
